# Netlify redirect rules: route API requests directly to Netlify serverless functions
/api/generate           /.netlify/functions/generate           200
/api/chat               /.netlify/functions/chat               200
/api/health             /.netlify/functions/health             200
/api/*                  /.netlify/functions/:splat             200
/.netlify/functions/*   /.netlify/functions/:splat             200
/*                      /index.html                            200

